From 843fffd711191fbb1a8ad351787514e695f3b8a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 13:25:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Address the three examination gaps: Halo performance,
 Expert Review, LLM loop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds the analysis and documentation that turn three asserted claims into
evidenced ones, and folds the results into the submission draft.

Performance (thesis chapter 5, new section 1.4.4):
- docs/benchmarks/halo_performance_analysis.md — full characterisation with
  bottleneck attribution, extrapolation and threats to validity.
- Headline finding contradicts the framing of the question: Halo generation
