+        A4 -->|invalid| A6
+        A4 -->|valid| A5
+    end
+
+    subgraph EXPERT["Reviewing Expert (domain specialist)"]
+        B1{"Coverage policy<br/>mandatory 100%<br/>other 20% stratified"}
